## Advanced: Custom Theming

Build a theme that matches your organisation's brand colours.

```elixir
brand_theme =
  Choreo.Theme.custom(
    colors: %{
      source: "#10b981",
      transform: "#3b82f6",
      buffer: "#f59e0b",
      conditional: "#8b5cf6",
      merge: "#ec4899",
      sink: "#ef4444"
    },
    node_fontcolor: "white",
    edge_color: "#94a3b8"
  )

Kino.VizJS.render(Dataflow.to_dot(microservices, theme: brand_theme), height: "800px", engine: "twopi")
Kino.Mermaid.new(Dataflow.to_mermaid(microservices, theme: brand_theme))
```

